# API Design

## POST /action

```json
{
    "action": "talk",
    "target": "scientist",
    "message": "How do I escape?"
}
```

Response:

```json
{
    "response": "...",
    "inventory": [],
    "room": "lab"
}
```

---

## GET /state

Returns

```json
{
    "inventory": [],
    "location": "lab",
    "door": false
}
```

---

## GET /history

Conversation history.

